  <title>Irakurtzeko komandoak</title>
  <p>GNOMEren parte diren kurtsore-nabigazioko komandoez gain, <app>Orca</app> aplikazioak dokumentuak irakurtzeko erabili daitezkeen komando gehiago eskaintzen ditu.</p>
  <note style="tip">
    <p>
      Below you will see several references to "KP". All
      "KP" keys are located on the numeric keypad. You will also notice that
      there are different keystrokes depending upon whether you are using a
      desktop or a laptop -- or more accurately, whether you are using
      <app>Orca</app>'s Desktop keyboard layout or its Laptop keyboard layout.
      For additional information, please see the
      <link xref="howto_keyboard_layout">Keyboard Layout</link> topic.
    </p>
  </note>
  <section id="flat_review">
    <title>Zure uneko kokalekua irakurtzea</title>
    <p><app>Orca</app> <link xref="commands_flat_review">Berrikuspen laurako komandoak</link> zure uneko kokalekua irakurtzeko erabili daitezke:</p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Irakurri uneko lerroa:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>ZT 8</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>I</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Irakurri uneko hitza:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>ZT 5</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>K</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Letreiatu uneko hitza:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>KP 5</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>K</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Fonetikoki letreiatu uneko hitza:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>KP 5</key></keyseq> (klik hirukoitza)</p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>K</key></keyseq> (klik hirukoitza)</p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Irakurri uneko karakterea:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>ZT 2</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Koma</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Fonetikoki ahoskatu uneko karakterea:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>ZT 2</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Koma</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Irakurri uneko karakterearen Unicode balioa:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <keyseq><key>ZT 2</key></keyseq> (klik hirukoitza)</p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Koma</key></keyseq> (klik hirukoitza)</p>
          </item>
        </list>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="say_all">
    <title>Esan dena</title>
    <p>'Esan dena' komandoari esker, <app>Orcak</app> dokumentu osoa irakurriko du zure momentuko kokalekutik hasita.</p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Mahaigaina: <key>ZT Plus</key></p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Puntu eta koma</key></keyseq></p>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="attributes_and_selection">
    <title>Testu-atributuak eta hautatutako testua</title>
    <p>
      <app>Orca</app> has a dedicated command for obtaining the attributes of the
      text at the caret location. In addition, if you use <app>Orca</app>'s
      Where Am I commands from within a text object in which text has been
      selected, <app>Orca</app> will announce the selected text. <app>Orca</app>'s
      command to speak the current selection will also perform this function in a
      text object.
    </p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Aurkeztu testu-atributuak: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>F</key></keyseq></p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Gauzatu 'Non nago' oinarrizko eragiketa:</p>
        <list>
          <item>
            <p>Mahaigaina: <key>ZT Enter</key></p>
          </item>
          <item>
            <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Return</key></keyseq></p>
          </item>
        </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Gauzatu 'Non nago' xehea:</p>
      <list>
        <item>
          <p>Mahaigaina: <key>ZT Enter</key> (klik bikoitza)</p>
        </item>
        <item>
          <p>Eramangarria: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Return</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
        </item>
      </list>
    </item>
    <item>
      <p>Irakurri uneko hautapena: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>Shift</key><key>Up</key></keyseq></p>
    </item>
  </list>
  </section>
  <section id="link_details">
    <title>Estekaren xehetasunak</title>
    <p>
      If you are on a link, <app>Orca</app>'s Basic Where Am I command can be
      used to announce the details associated with the link such as the link type,
      if the link is visited, the site description, and file size. If you would
      instead prefer a dedicated command for this purpose, you can bind <app>Orca</app>'s
      Speak Link Details command to a keystroke. Please see <link xref="howto_key_bindings">
      Modifying Keybindings</link> for information on how to do so.
    </p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Irakurri estekaren xehetasunak: (Lotu gabea)</p>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="browse_and_focus_modes">
    <title>Arakatze- eta fokuratze-moduak</title>
    <p><app>Orcaren</app> arakatze- eta fokuratze-moduen bidez, web-edukia irakurtzetik harekin aritzera, eta alderantziz, aldatu zaitezke.</p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Aldatu arakatze-moduaren eta fokuratze-moduaren artean: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>A</key></keyseq></p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Gaitu fokuratze itsaskorraren modua: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>A</key></keyseq> (klik bikoitza)</p>
      </item>
      <item>
        <p>Gaitu arakatze itsaskorraren modua: <keyseq><key>Orca aldatzailea</key><key>A</key></keyseq> (klik hirukoitza)</p>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
  <section id="toggling_layout_mode">
    <title>Diseinu-modua txandakatzea</title>
    <p>
      When Layout mode is enabled, <app>Orca</app>'s caret navigation will respect
      the on-screen layout of the content and present the full line, including any
      links or form fields on that line. When Layout mode is disabled, <app>Orca</app>
      will treat objects such as links and form fields as if they were on separate
      lines, both for presentation and navigation.
    </p>
    <p>
      <app>Orca</app> provides a command to switch between Layout mode and Object mode.
      This command is unbound by default. Please see <link xref="howto_key_bindings">Modifying
      Keybindings</link> for information on how to bind unbound commands.
    </p>
    <list>
      <item>
        <p>Txandakatu diseinu-moduaren eta objektu-moduaren artean: (Lotu gabea)</p>
      </item>
    </list>
  </section>
